#: eventviews.kcfg:668
msgid "With this setting you can configure whether the domain part of the free/busy URL has to match the domain part of the user ID you are looking for. For example, if this option is 'true', then looking for the free/busy data of joe@mydomain.com on the server www.yourdomain.com will fail."
msgstr "Mit disse Instellen leggst Du fast, wat de Domään vun de Free-/Bunnenlist ehr Adress de sülve wesen mutt as de Domään vun de Bruker-ID, na de Du söchst. Is disse Optschoon anmaakt, muttst Du op den Server \"www.eenreekner.net\" nich na den Bruker \"klaas@annerreekner.net\" söken."

